WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:01.840
Hey there.

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:03.990
I want to talk a little bit
about my experience with,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.150
uh, the Tonal, um,

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.730
workout device that I got.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:13.830
I, um, about a year and a half ago,
I was able to try a Tonal at a

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.770
showroom, uh, here in the DC
area, and I was really impressed,

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.110
but the, the price was,
uh, pretty challenging.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.800
It was not a small amount of money.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.950
And so I really wanted to try it, but I
wasn't sure if it was something that I

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.290
was gonna do on a regular basis, so I...

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.890
It was really hard to spend
that money or even finance it.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.890
It would--

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.920
I just wasn't sure.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.570
But then I got contacted by Whim, W-H-I-M,

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:42.490
Whim, and, um, they were gonna
be renting the Tonal device,

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.830
and it was, uh, a, you know,
reasonable price that could be done.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.350
And I thought, "Well, I can rent it for
a few months and see if it's something

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:53.250
that fits into my lifestyle, something
I'm actually gonna do and not just hang

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.470
my clothes on it or whatever."

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:58.190
So I got the device, uh, installed.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.770
The delivery process was
a little challenging.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.190
I was trying to have it
delivered here to my work,

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.360
and then we couldn't install
it here because of the,

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.560
the way the walls are done.

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:11.130
And so then I opted to have
it done at my apartment,

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:13.390
and there was some confusion, and
they went to the wrong address.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.930
So that was a little bit
challenging and disappointing,

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:20.350
but I did finally get the unit, and I
can only say I'm tremendously impressed

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:21.360
with this unit.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:23.180
So, um,

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.990
I would still give the unit five stars.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.550
If I was gonna take off a
little bit for the delivery,

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.040
it wouldn't be a whole star.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.360
Really impressive.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.290
And the device itself is killer.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.460
I've never, um,

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:40.060
had a device that did exactly
what I wanted it to do.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:44.740
Uh, there's so many great exercises,
and the coaches are great.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.230
I just can't recommend it more highly if
you're wanting to work on strength at

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.240
home.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.130
Uh, so get you a Tonal, and if
you want to rent it through Whim,

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:54.410
I recommend that for sure.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.600
If you just want to buy it,
it's definitely worth it.
